WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.389
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.389 --> 00:00:05.939
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:09.439
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.439 --> 00:00:09.754
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.754 --> 00:00:12.412
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:15.916
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.036 --> 00:00:21.441
Recall the training/inference distinction, then reveal the expected answer.

00:00:21.441 --> 00:00:25.892
Hide the first explanation and attempt the distinction again from memory.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:31.386
Reveal the prompt-context explanation for the second question.

00:00:31.386 --> 00:00:34.738
Open the third explanation and compare the proposed experiment.

00:00:34.738 --> 00:00:39.564
Reveal the remaining answer to complete the three-question review.

00:00:39.564 --> 00:00:43.739
Inspect the counter showing all three explanations revealed.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:48.148
Reset all three answers for a fresh recall attempt.

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:53.099
Reveal the training distinction again after the reset.

00:00:53.099 --> 00:00:59.845
Hide the answer to leave the question ready for another independent attempt.
